flowchart LR
    CLIENT[Client Application]
    API[REST API]
    LLM[LLM Summarization]
    TRITON[Triton Inference<br/>Pyannote + Whisper]
    subgraph STORE[Data Storage]
        S3[(S3/MinIO)]
        PG[(Postgres)]
    end

    CLIENT -->|HTTP POST audio| API
    API -->|Inference request| TRITON
    TRITON -->|Model outputs| API
    API -->|JSON results| CLIENT
    API <-->|Summarization| LLM

    API -->|Archive audio| S3
    API -->|Session and results| PG

    classDef client fill:#f6d6e5,stroke:#6b4a59,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef api fill:#fbd8c0,stroke:#7b5b49,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef triton fill:#d7ecd1,stroke:#4e6e49,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef store fill:#d7e8fb,stroke:#4a6482,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
    classDef llm fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b8860b,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827

    class CLIENT client
    class API api
    class TRITON triton
    class LLM llm
    class S3,PG store

    style STORE fill:#e8f1f8,stroke:#7a9abb,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827
